## 6.3. Football Visualizations: Pitch & Shot Maps

Visualizations render dynamically on the client via SVG and D3:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   FOOTBALL PITCH (SVG)                   │
│                                                          │
│     ┌────┐                      (•) Penalty Spot ┌────┐  │
│     │    │                                       │  o │  │
│     │    │                                       │ o  │  │
│     │    │                                       │    │  │
│     └────┘                                       └────┘  │
│                                                          │
│   Legend:  o Goal (xG: 0.72)    x Missed Shot (xG: 0.12) │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

> [!NOTE]
> **Coordinate Contract:**  
> The backend delivers normalized coordinates on a standardized pitch dimension ($0 \le x \le 120$, $0 \le y \le 80$).  
> The frontend SVG maps these values dynamically to responsive viewBox dimensions without distortion.

